1
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:05,680
HaxTalks Subs
Translations by MysteriousAura

2
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:24,180
I am Guan Fei Bai. I am honoured to fight you, Miss Luo Luo

3
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:30,890
Mister, don't forget to help me!

4
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:37,810
How will your Highness be fighting?

5
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:07,140
The sun paints the clouds a crimson red

6
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:10,930
Resentment gives the flowers a scarlet hue

7
00:01:13,430 --> 00:01:18,220
I look back at all those I have killed, the sound is like darkness

8
00:01:18,810 --> 00:01:22,720
So please just stand under the night sky.

9
00:01:23,930 --> 00:01:26,850
Who isn’t afraid of the terrors of nature?

10
00:01:26,850 --> 00:01:29,930
Who isn’t scared of the empty sky?

11
00:01:31,270 --> 00:01:34,810
Who hasn’t experienced the stubbornness of adolescence?

12
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:41,220
Depressed with their fate, and crying with grief.

13
00:01:41,770 --> 00:01:44,270
The youth are affectionate

14
00:01:46,390 --> 00:01:50,600
The heavens can be heartless

15
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:55,600
Using life and death to break your heart.

16
00:01:56,060 --> 00:02:00,470
Although God may not be willing to help,

17
00:02:00,810 --> 00:02:03,600
All I need is a sword in my hands

18
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:05,560
To break through the stars

19
00:02:07,020 --> 00:02:10,350
And change my fate.

20
00:02:10,350 --> 00:02:14,060
The vast sky and land are like a giant heart

21
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:19,060
Affecting my life, my emotions, my love, and my hatred

22
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:21,470
Like a indisputable fact,

23
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:27,680
And changing all of us.

24
00:02:31,430 --> 00:02:33,350
I don’t ask for a long life

25
00:02:35,350 --> 00:02:39,770
I just want to live peacefully in this world.

26
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:48,390
Way of Choices

27
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:51,680
Relying on the White Crane (Part 2)

28
00:02:55,470 --> 00:03:00,020
I've heard that out of the seven strongest, Guan Fei Bai is the most aloof

29
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:03,770
Judging by your appearance, that seems to be true

30
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,770
Is there a problem with fighting me?

31
00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:09,970
Of course not. There's just one thing I want cleared up though

32
00:03:10,060 --> 00:03:12,770
No matter the circumstances, I will not dare harm you

33
00:03:13,770 --> 00:03:15,600
I am a student of Orthodox Academy

34
00:03:16,220 --> 00:03:19,680
You are a student of Li Shan Sword Sect, and you want to fight me, a student of Orthodox Academy

35
00:03:19,930 --> 00:03:21,220
I naturally can't refuse this offer

36
00:03:23,350 --> 00:03:26,770
There's no need to hold back. Just fight me like you would with any other student

37
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:30,100
Let's both use our full powers, and see who wins

38
00:03:30,890 --> 00:03:32,310
Your Highness is absolutely correct

39
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:36,270
However, the rankings for the students on the Honour Roll are always changing

40
00:03:36,930 --> 00:03:40,390
But before these changes happen, the current rankings are accurate

41
00:03:41,310 --> 00:03:43,970
You're ranked ninth, while I'm ranked fourth

42
00:03:44,350 --> 00:03:47,390
Therefore, it is impossible for the ninth ranked student to beat the fourth ranked one

43
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:51,270
If we only look at rankings, what's the point of Qing Tong Yan?

44
00:03:51,890 --> 00:03:53,810
Also, what would be the point of the Grand Examination?

45
00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:57,270
Who's stronger and who's weaker...
that doesn't matter until we actually fight each other

46
00:04:01,970 --> 00:04:06,310
Besides, if what you said is true, how did Tang Thirty-Six, 
a lower ranked student, beat your younger brother?

47
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:09,970
That's because someone helped him out

48
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:15,470
Stop trying to make excuses,
 I know that you're trying to cover for your brother

49
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:19,270
Brother. For this match, you have to concentrate

50
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:23,060
Don't get too cocky, or else you'll soil the name of Li Shan

51
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:27,470
Please, your Highness, teach me

52
00:04:34,140 --> 00:04:36,680
Look at that power! Are you not worried?

53
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,140
Luo Luo will prevail for sure

54
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:42,770
You really have confidence in her, huh?

55
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:49,470
The sword that Guan Fei Bai is using is intriguing indeed

56
00:04:50,430 --> 00:04:52,390
Actually, I think it's pretty funny

57
00:04:53,270 --> 00:04:55,640
Although his oldest brother Qiu Shan Jun has the tools to counter us,

58
00:04:55,970 --> 00:04:59,930
He only uses a cheap sword no matter who he is fighting

59
00:05:01,590 --> 00:05:04,630
This Guan Fei Bai guy, he looks up to his older brother

60
00:05:04,630 --> 00:05:08,510
So of course, he copies Qiu Shan Jun and uses an ordinary sword as well

61
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:13,630
Simply ridiculous. In my opinion, there's no way
 he can be even half as good as Qiu Shan Jun

62
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:18,170
Slow down a bit there

63
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,210
The Empress is an important figure

64
00:05:21,010 --> 00:05:24,260
If there's even the slightest threat of danger, it will not be accepted

65
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:27,880
We only use this for special occasions, it's not dangerous

66
00:05:28,170 --> 00:05:29,710
Is that so? All the better

67
00:05:30,590 --> 00:05:32,130
How irritating

68
00:05:32,380 --> 00:05:35,840
The xiu xing that Li Shan students use is Xuan Gong

69
00:05:36,130 --> 00:05:39,260
Therefore, the power we have is much stronger than that of your Highness

70
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:40,510
But!

71
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:45,800
In this case, there's no need to unleash my full power. 
If I do that though, it will offset my advantage

72
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:52,170
Of course, since I am fighting Miss Luo Luo,
 I have no choice but to get rid of that advantage

73
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,840
No spells, only regular combat?

74
00:05:58,380 --> 00:06:02,630
That means Gou Han Shi will do the same thing as last match, and interrupt if they start losing

75
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:04,590
Correct

76
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:08,510
He wants the last two matches to be combined into one single match!

77
00:06:09,670 --> 00:06:13,010
He really wants to win that bad, huh? 
That's probably why he's resorting to this tactic

78
00:06:13,710 --> 00:06:15,260
Won't doing that go against what he was talking about before?

79
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:16,960
After you!

80
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:18,460
No, after you!

81
00:06:40,090 --> 00:06:41,630
Why is Gou Han Shi not doing anything?

82
00:06:42,670 --> 00:06:44,550
Maybe he's waiting for Chen Chang Sheng to make the first move

83
00:06:45,510 --> 00:06:46,510
Lifting Earth!

84
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,170
Dong Lin Seven Stars!

85
00:06:57,170 --> 00:06:57,960
Okay

86
00:07:02,710 --> 00:07:05,550
What martial technique is this?
 I've never seen it before...

87
00:07:06,050 --> 00:07:08,380
That's the martial technique that the Dong Lin Province created, right?

88
00:07:08,710 --> 00:07:12,460
It's very obscure, so few people recognize it

89
00:07:12,550 --> 00:07:16,050
Nice attack and nice defence!

90
00:07:16,420 --> 00:07:20,260
Chen Chang Sheng is using Wind and Rain Sword of Mountain Zhong

91
00:07:20,510 --> 00:07:26,670
And your Highness is using Falling Rain. This will be good

92
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:33,340
Who would've thought that Gou Han Shi
 will use such rare techniques? How marvelous!

93
00:07:35,170 --> 00:07:36,920
Return from the North!

94
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:47,670
He changed from Dong Lin style to Li Shan Sword style, 
how can we even fight him?

95
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:48,880
Bright Snow!

96
00:07:49,130 --> 00:07:49,760
Frozen Ice!

97
00:07:50,130 --> 00:07:50,920
Fish Trap!

98
00:07:51,170 --> 00:07:55,130
<i>Bright Snow? Frozen Ice? Aren't those movement techniques?</i>

99
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:00,460
Bright Snow!

100
00:08:02,550 --> 00:08:03,380
Frozen Ice!

101
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:07,550
Fish Trap!

102
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:19,710
What kind of technique is that? It's so fast!

103
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:25,090
Those moves, it's the Xue Lao City demon clan's specialty!

104
00:08:25,510 --> 00:08:28,340
It's really powerful, defending against it is hard

105
00:08:29,380 --> 00:08:31,260
Thirteen Returns to the West!

106
00:08:41,170 --> 00:08:43,340
That move will let you win for sure, why aren't you using it?

107
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:47,590
Mister, I don't know how to use it...

108
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:52,340
Thirteen Returns to the West? 
Have you ever heard of that before?

109
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:55,170
No way. What kind of technique is that?

110
00:08:55,800 --> 00:09:00,300
Even your Highness doesn't know. 
Maybe he made it up?

111
00:09:02,130 --> 00:09:05,460
Sigh. If you knew that technique, 
Orthodox Academy will win for sure

112
00:09:08,590 --> 00:09:11,880
It's been a long time since I last saw Thirteen Returns to the West

113
00:09:12,210 --> 00:09:16,590
And it's also been equally as long since I last witnessed such an exiciting match

114
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:21,960
That year, Zhou Du Fu and Tai Zong were fighting at Luo Yang

115
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:24,960
This match isn't any different

116
00:09:25,420 --> 00:09:28,840
What is village chief talking about? Who's Zhou Du Fu?

117
00:09:29,090 --> 00:09:32,010
And how strong is Tai Zong?

118
00:09:32,260 --> 00:09:36,260
Can you really compare that battle to now?

119
00:09:38,090 --> 00:09:42,380
Well of course, their skill levels are far from Zhou Du Fu and Tai Zong

120
00:09:42,550 --> 00:09:46,210
But, it's just that the battle at Luo Yang..

121
00:09:46,710 --> 00:09:50,210
Zhou Du Fu and Tai Zong were both adolescents

122
00:09:51,010 --> 00:09:55,210
They were only a bit older than these two

123
00:09:57,670 --> 00:10:09,170
Mr. Tai Zong, one of the five saints, his power is almost unmatched. In the chaos that ensued in the Capital a long time ago, he refused to leave the Empress' side, and eventually helped create the Capital as it is now.

124
00:10:10,420 --> 00:10:11,260
Move #7-

125
00:10:11,630 --> 00:10:12,420
Flipped Crow!

126
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,760
Welcome, Mr. Zong

127
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:32,670
This current match is a once in a life time opportunity to witness. 
Missing it would be such a shame

128
00:10:37,260 --> 00:10:38,880
And now, move #11

129
00:10:39,710 --> 00:10:41,090
Principal Sword Technique of Mountain Li!

130
00:10:55,710 --> 00:10:57,010
Begin Golden Crow Sword!

131
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:58,880
Li Shan Sword Sect technique #3

132
00:10:59,340 --> 00:11:00,460
Flash Freeze!

133
00:11:03,090 --> 00:11:03,800
Flying White!

134
00:11:09,210 --> 00:11:09,960
You're getting reckless

135
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:13,260
Hey! How come you're not doing anything 
when you're supposed to be doing something?

136
00:11:35,210 --> 00:11:37,300
Oops, looks like I won

137
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:44,880
They won...that means Orthodox Academy won all three matches!

138
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:50,260
Gou Shan Shi lost to Chen Chang Sheng...
what kind of person is that Chang Sheng guy??

139
00:11:53,630 --> 00:11:54,510
What?

140
00:12:01,380 --> 00:12:04,010
You go, Miss Luo Luo!

141
00:12:06,550 --> 00:12:09,710
If I could use spells...

142
00:12:09,710 --> 00:12:12,800
Your techniques won't be even able to touch me!

143
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:16,050
If we could really use spells

144
00:12:16,050 --> 00:12:18,050
After our seventy-sixth rally,

145
00:12:18,050 --> 00:12:19,840
I would've broke through your defences

146
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:22,550
With your current abilities...

147
00:12:22,710 --> 00:12:25,300
It is impossible for you to use spells of that caliber against me

148
00:12:26,010 --> 00:12:27,010
Is that so?

149
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,880
Wait a minute...

150
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:42,630
Your Highness was able to break through that barrier...

151
00:12:43,010 --> 00:12:44,630
I am related to the Demon Emperor

152
00:12:44,630 --> 00:12:46,630
Although I am naturally able to cast spells,

153
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:50,050
I have held back, and only used xiu xing methods known to mankind

154
00:12:50,420 --> 00:12:52,130
Thank you for your help!

155
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:56,010
Admirable!

156
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:58,050
You are too kind!

157
00:12:59,090 --> 00:13:02,590
The three of us originally wanted to defend our senior brother's honour

158
00:13:03,210 --> 00:13:04,960
But, we were unable to do that, as we lost

159
00:13:06,510 --> 00:13:10,880
However, even though Orthodox Academy won, it doesn't mean much

160
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:15,920
Since Xu You Rong is not here, it doesn't count

161
00:13:16,670 --> 00:13:20,300
Therefore, your marriage vow is still a piece of paper

162
00:13:24,170 --> 00:13:31,260
Wait, that white crane, I recognize it! 
That's Xu You Rong's white crane!

163
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:51,800
Did you hear the news? Out of all the students from the south, 
aside from those intending on participating in the Grand Examination,

164
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:57,920
Everyone else already left the Capital quietly trying to slip away

165
00:13:58,300 --> 00:14:01,760
Doesn't that mean the marriage proposal for the Qiu Shan family was unsuccessful?

166
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:04,170
Why would they remain here and be ridiculed?

167
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:05,670
Yes

168
00:14:11,010 --> 00:14:12,260
What's with that dumb laugh?

169
00:14:12,260 --> 00:14:15,920
Stop causing a ruckus. Our master is thinking about something!

170
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:20,840
The people from Li Shan and the Qiu Shan family,
 they only did what they thought was right

171
00:14:22,510 --> 00:14:25,170
They were uninformed about the condition of the marriage

172
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:28,760
It isn't their fault for not knowing the circumstances

173
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:35,170
You're right as always, Mister!

174
00:14:35,170 --> 00:14:38,710
You are my master, if you tell me to do something, I will do it

175
00:14:39,510 --> 00:14:41,800
Whatever your Highness does, I will do as well

176
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:47,380
I don't think it's that way. 
It looks like they're just ashamed of themselves

177
00:14:53,670 --> 00:15:00,760
Wait, that white crane, I recognize it! 
That's Xu You Rong's white crane!

178
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:06,170
Hey, look at that! That white crane has a letter to deliver!

179
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:09,630
Does that mean Xu You Rong has something to say?

180
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:11,880
What is the meaning of this?

181
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:24,880
Could this be?

182
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:27,300
T/N: Lou Lou is not actually her little sister. This is just how the students called each other if they were the apprentice to the same master back then just like Li Shan students

183
00:15:26,300 --> 00:15:27,300
That, that's older sister!

184
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,960
Hey! Your future wife is here!

185
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:36,300
Hello everyone

186
00:15:37,130 --> 00:15:41,590
I've heard that Li Shan came to discuss the marriage proposal, and for that, I am very grateful

187
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:46,960
This is a pleasure for me, 
and is also a representation of the love and care they have for me

188
00:15:48,510 --> 00:15:54,840
But, I have my own views regarding my marriage, please understand

189
00:15:55,670 --> 00:15:58,420
Look, Xu You Rong didn't agree to marry Qiu Shan Jun in the first place!

190
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:05,010
That means the Qiu Shan family and the Divine General just assumed that she would agree, and came here

191
00:16:05,210 --> 00:16:06,130
That's true

192
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:12,050
The relation between Qiu Shan Jun and I is not like husband and wife, but more like brother and sister

193
00:16:13,050 --> 00:16:15,590
I highly respect Qiu Shan Jun

194
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:20,050
However, I have never thought about marrying him before

195
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:24,130
And why is that? That's because I am already engaged to someone else

196
00:16:25,380 --> 00:16:28,550
My future husband is called...Chen Chang Sheng

197
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:11,420
Mister, shouldn't we start classes at Orthodox Academy now?

198
00:17:12,670 --> 00:17:16,090
Yes, the Grand Examination is coming up

199
00:17:16,460 --> 00:17:19,300
All of us need to try our best

200
00:17:20,130 --> 00:17:21,550
Follow me, let's go study

201
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:30,170
<u>HaxTalks Subs</u>
Translations:       MysteriousAura, Uknowhu
Encoding:                                      Greatwulf
Timing:                                   TalkedCracker
Typesetting:                           TalkedCracker

202
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:30,170
Thanks for watching. See you in Season 2

203
00:17:22,380 --> 00:17:26,420
Books again? Does this guy do anything else besides read??

204
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:28,590
You'll know in the future

